Driver end-to-end on this fixture (tools/rustle_pipeline.sh stages candidates, assign, flag; spec 2026-10-02 §7).

The fixture has no O1 products (its one locus gives the families stage no family), so the three files the families stage
would write are staged by hand from the fixture itself, plus a one-gene GFF for the flag stage's scan. From the repo root:

  T=$(mktemp -d); P=$T/fx; FX=tests/fixtures/o3_candidates; BIN=<CARGO_TARGET_DIR>/release
  cp $FX/copies.tsv $P.fam.copies.tsv                       # the copy table (mcl_families' P.fam.copies.tsv layout)
  cp $FX/copies.fa  $P.fam.copies.fa
  printf 'MCL0\tchrT:5000-18100\n' > $P.fam.copies.regions  # mcl_families' layout: the hull +- 5 kb (start >= 1)
  printf 'chrT\tfixture\tgene\t10001\t13100\t.\t+\t.\tID=geneA;Name=geneA\n' > $P.gff
  minimap2 -x splice -d $P.splice.mmi $FX/genome.fa
  for st in candidates assign flag; do
    bash tools/rustle_pipeline.sh $st --bam $FX/reads.bam --fasta $FX/genome.fa --index $P.splice.mmi --gff $P.gff \
      --out $P --bin $BIN --threads 2
  done

